#: src/gunyahvm/macos.py
msgid "Gunyah could not map the macOS boot memory. Close other applications to free contiguous host RAM, then start the VM again."
msgstr "Gunyah 无法映射 macOS 启动内存。请关闭其他应用以释放连续的宿主内存，再启动虚拟机。"

#: src/gunyahvm/macos.py
msgid "The host could not allocate and lock the macOS boot memory. See crosvm.stderr for the allocation error."
msgstr "宿主无法分配并锁定 macOS 启动内存。具体错误见本次运行的 crosvm.stderr。"

